  m_text: "Business insurance protects your company from unexpected problems\u2014like
    accidents, damages, or lawsuits. In this game, it helps you avoid big financial
    losses that could set you back.\n\nThere are different types of coverage, like:\nProperty
    Insurance: Protects your buildings, equipment, or inventory.\L\nLiability Insurance:
    Covers costs if someone is hurt or sues your business.\L\nBuying the right insurance
    at the right time can save you money in the long run. Smart coverage decisions
    keep your business running!"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6e6891c03f13f1e44a213bc615ab5855, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 3712076712150920612, guid: 6e6891c03f13f1e44a213bc615ab5855, type: 2}
